       <t indent="0" pn="section-1-1">The UIDPLUS extension of the Internet Message Access Protocol <xref target="IMAP4" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="IMAP4"/>
 provides a set of features intended to reduce the amount of time and
 resources used by some client operations.  The features in UIDPLUS
